  - title: "03 / Wire the DOWN path"
    explanation: "W02 Battery_positive → DOWN_Feed_IN. W08 DOWN_Feed_OUT → Lower_Limit_IN. W11 Lower_Limit_OUT → Motor_B. W10 Motor_A → DOWN_Return_IN. W05 Battery_negative → DOWN_Return_OUT. Both DOWN contacts close in DOWN. The lower limit is open at the bottom."
    caption: "B POSITIVE TO A • LOWER LIMIT STOPS DOWN"
    parts:
    - id: positive
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.08, y: 0.62}
      label: "BATTERY +"
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.34, b: 0.4, a: 1}
    - id: feed
