  - title: "04 / Top lamp and the five checks"
    explanation: "W03 Battery_positive → Top_Lamp_IN. W13 Top_Lamp_OUT → R_LED_IN. W14 R_LED_OUT → Lamp_A. W06 Battery_negative → Lamp_K.\nTest 1/5: DOWN at bottom is blocked. 2/5: UP raises. 3/5: UP stops at the top and the lamp lights. 4/5: DOWN lowers and the lamp goes out. 5/5: DOWN stops at the bottom."
    caption: "TOP CONTACT → 330 Ω → LAMP A • LAMP K → RETURN"
    parts:
    - id: positive
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.09, y: 0.62}
      label: "BATTERY +"
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.34, b: 0.4, a: 1}
    - id: top_contact
      kind: 5
      position: {x: 0.29, y: 0.62}
      label: "TOP CONTACT"
      color: {r: 0.31, g: 0.88, b: 0.84, a: 1}
